# GitHub org profile assets

Org profile images and brand archives belong in **`{org}/.github/profile/assets/`** (not repo-root `assets/`).

Load Cursor skill **`github-profile-assets`** when creating, moving, exporting, or locating profile logos, favicons, or revision folders under `.github`.

Bootstrap context (create the repo, minimal profile copy): skill **`bootstrap-org`**.
